@startuml
skinparam lifelineStrategy solid
autonumber
title Diagrama Cierre 1: GET /api/v1/logistics/closings (Filtros en Cascada y Lista de Cierres)

actor "Liquidador / Supervisor / Cajero" as User
participant "App Web (Frontend)" as Web
participant "Gateway Controller" as Gateway
participant "Logistics Closing Service" as Service
participant "transport_orders DB" as OrdersDB
participant "routes & trucks DB" as RouteTruckDB
participant "warehouse_closings DB\n(transport_order_warehouse_closings)" as WhClosingDB
participant "collection_closings DB\n(transport_order_collection_closings)" as CollClosingDB

User -> Web: Selecciona filtros en cascada (Fecha -> Chofer -> Usuario -> Placa -> N° OT)
Web -> Gateway: GET /api/v1/logistics/closings\n?closingDate=2026-02-15&driverId=1024&warehouseUser=CARLOS.ROJAS01\n&truckPlate=4284 IYB&orderCode=525420010&status=LIQUIDATED
Gateway -> Service: getLogisticsClosingsList(filterDto)

Service -> OrdersDB: 1. findTransportOrdersByFilters(filterDto)
OrdersDB --> Service: ordersList[] (ej. IDs: [525420010, 525420002])

Service -> RouteTruckDB: 2. findRoutesAndTrucks(routeIds, truckIds)
RouteTruckDB --> Service: routesAndTrucksInfo[] (Chofer, Empresa, Placa, Tipo Camión)

Service -> WhClosingDB: 3. findWarehouseClosings(orderIds)
WhClosingDB --> Service: warehouseClosings[] (status, total_dispatch_qty, total_returned_qty, amounts in BOB)

Service -> CollClosingDB: 4. findCollectionClosings(orderIds)
CollClosingDB --> Service: collectionClosings[] (status, cash_amount, total_to_render, driver_collected)

Service -> Service: 5. computeKpisAndCascadeOptions(orders, whClosings, collClosings)
note right of Service
  Lógica en Memoria:
  - KPIs: Total OTs, Cerradas Almacén, Cuadradas Caja, Total Montos (Bs)
  - Cascada: Fechas -> Choferes asociados -> Usuarios -> Placas -> OTs
end note

Service --> Gateway: closingsListResponse
Gateway --> Web: 200 OK (Listado de Cierres + KPIs + Opciones Cascada)
Web --> User: Renderiza panel de filtros en cascada, KPIs superiores y tabla de OTs
@enduml
